            <span>BUILD: <strong class="text-cyber-500">cargo check (7s - sccache)</strong></span>
            <span>ESP32 IP: <strong class="text-green-400">192.168.100.3</strong></span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
            <span>MQTT WS: <strong class="text-white">192.168.100.10:9001</strong></span>
            <span>TOPIC: <strong class="text-cyber-500">scannerpro/collab/...</strong></span>
